# M8: on the creation screen the figure holds the starter kit of the class being chosen
# (docs/PROTOCOL_ITEMS.md §6), so cycling the four classes visibly changes the character. Both races,
# eight screenshots. Kits (gamedata/items.toml): warrior 1 + 2 (sword, shield), rogue 3 + 3 (two
# daggers), mage 4 (ember staff), priest 5 (mace).
wait 5
waitfor login+idle 120
clickon login.username
text m8_classes
clickon login.password
text gizli123
key enter
waitfor charcreate+race+idle 900
clickon create.race.aydor
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
wait 8
scene expectpreviewequip 1 2
screenshot 01_aydor_warrior.png
clickon create.class.2
wait 8
scene expectpreviewequip 3 3
screenshot 02_aydor_rogue.png
clickon create.class.3
wait 8
scene expectpreviewequip 4 0
screenshot 03_aydor_mage.png
clickon create.class.4
wait 8
scene expectpreviewequip 5 0
screenshot 04_aydor_priest.png
# The other race (back to the race step).
clickon create.back
waitfor charcreate+race 60
clickon create.race.kargan
clickon create.next
waitfor charcreate+details 60
clickon create.class.1
wait 8
scene expectpreviewequip 1 2
screenshot 05_kargan_warrior.png
clickon create.class.2
wait 8
scene expectpreviewequip 3 3
screenshot 06_kargan_rogue.png
clickon create.class.3
wait 8
scene expectpreviewequip 4 0
screenshot 07_kargan_mage.png
clickon create.class.4
wait 8
scene expectpreviewequip 5 0
screenshot 08_kargan_priest.png
quit
